Upload Process 

User can select file (.xlsx) via drag-drop or browse. 

The maximum files size allowed is up to 50MB. 

After the file uploaded it will be validated as per the business validations. 
The application will only consider the data from the first 7 columns from 1st sheet 
only for validation purpose. Any data beyond 7th column as well as in other than 1st sheet 
will be ignored. 

In case there are any validation failures, an error file will be generated immediately 
and will be auto downloaded, along with the error remarks column. User can resolve the 
listed issues and reupload the error file itself  with required excel file. changes

Once the uploaded data found valid system will create a batch for voucher posting. 
